title: SuspiciousGuy_Dialogue
---
<<declare $suspiciousGuy_DialoguePhase = "">>
<<declare $aura = 0>>
<<dialoguePhaseSetter SuspiciousGuy_NPC>>

//Declare Variables Here

<<if $suspiciousGuy_DialoguePhase == "QuestIntroduction">>
    <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestIntroduction>>
<<elseif $suspiciousGuy_DialoguePhase == "QuestPhaseOne">>
    <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestPhaseOne>>
<<elseif $suspiciousGuy_DialoguePhase == "QuestShopliftingPathway">>
    <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestShopliftingPathway>>
<<elseif $suspiciousGuy_DialoguePhase == "QuestSneakyPicturePathway">>
    <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestSneakyPicturePathway>>
<<elseif $suspiciousGuy_DialoguePhase == "QuestWin">>
    <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestWin>>
<<elseif $suspiciousGuy_DialoguePhase == "QuestFumbled">>
    <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestFumbled>>
<<endif>>
===

title: SuspiciousGuy_QuestIntroduction
---
Suspicious Guy: Hey you *snickers*
You: Hey, is something going on?
Suspicious Guy: Nothing much, just checking up on you
Suspicious Guy: Anyways, I heard you got yelled at today by Ms. Smith haha
    ->You:  *smirks* And why is any of that your concern?
        <<set $aura += 20>>
        <<add_aura GameController 20>>
        Suspicious Guy: To be fair, if I were you i’d be embarrassed
        <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestPhaseOne>>
    ->You:  Why do you care?
        <<set $aura += 10>>
        <<add_aura GameController 10>>
        Suspicious Guy: Nothing much, I mean I'm concerned about you thats all
        <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestPhaseOne>>
    ->You: Uh.. And what?
        Suspicious Guy: What? Don’t you think it's embarrassing?
            -> You: And you’re certain you’re just trying to check up on me?
                <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestPhaseOne>> 
            -> You: If you’re just trying to provoke me right now, you’re wasting your time
                <<set $aura += 20>>
                <<add_aura GameController 20>>
                <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestPhaseOne>>
===

title: SuspiciousGuy_QuestPhaseOne
---
->You: Then care to explain that one time when I saw you shoplifting? 
    <<set $aura += 20>>
    <<add_aura GameController 20>>
    <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestShopliftingPathway>>
->You: Then what about other day when I saw you taking pictures of Ms. Smith without her knowing
    <<set $aura += 20>>
    <<add_aura GameController 20>>
    <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestSneakyPicturePathway>>
===

title: SuspiciousGuy_QuestShopliftingPathway
---
Suspicious Guy: HAHAHA, What a joke, you think you’re so tough huh?    
Suspicious Guy: Now then, what did you even see me shoplift if you’re so confident in that statement   
    ->Shampoo
        <<set $aura += 60>>
        <<add_aura GameController 60>>
        Suspicious Guy: (intimidated) Y-y-y-y-y-you actually saw?    
        You: What? Haha, you’d think I wouldn’t know?
        You: You went to the personal care aisle, and looked suspicious. A quick observation, and I knew you had no points at all and as I expected, you stuffed it right in your bag. 
        <<jump SuspiciousGuy_CheckResolution>>
    ->Pencil
        Suspicious Guy: Oh nah you’re just larping, you’d think I'd ever steal anything as puny like that?
	    You : Oh.. well
        <<jump SuspiciousGuy_CheckResolution>>
    ->Nintendo 3Ds
        Suspicious Guy: Oh nah, I already have that, why the hell would I shoplift that, nobody in their right mind would do so
        Suspicious Guy: You’re just making things up
	    You: I see..
        <<jump SuspiciousGuy_CheckResolution>>
===
title: SuspiciousGuy_QuestSneakyPicturePathway
---
Suspicious Guy: W-what?
You: Oh? You didn’t hear me the first time? You were taking pictures of Ms. Smith without her knowing
Suspicious Guy: H-hold on, you can’t accuse me of something like that.
    ->You: Well, I'm not accusing you, I'm just simply conveying what I saw 
        Suspicious Guy: well its not like you have proof anyways
        You: I’m not interested in arguing, I just told you what I saw.
        Suspicious Guy: you can’t prove anything, stop wasting my time 
        <<jump SuspiciousGuy_CheckResolution>>
    ->You: Hah.. why’re you getting so defensive?
        <<set $aura += 60>>
        <<add_aura GameController 60>>
        Suspicious Guy: Well, it's not like you have proof anyways haha
        You: *looks up at security cameras*
        You: You should at least be thankful that I didn’t tell anyone..
        Suspicious Guy: … 
        <<jump SuspiciousGuy_CheckResolution>>
===

title: SuspiciousGuy_CheckResolution
---
<<if $aura >= 50>>
    <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestWin>>
<<else>>
    <<jump SuspiciousGuy_QuestFumbled>>
<<endif>>
===

title: SuspiciousGuy_QuestWin
---
<<set $ayanokoji_DialoguePhase = "QuestCompleted">>
<<dialoguePhaseGetter Ayanokoji "QuestCompleted">>
Suspicious Guy: Sigh.. Fine you win.. Forget anything that I said earlier
You: Sure
Suspicious Guy: Ugh, you’re seriously annoying, you know that? 
You: That doesn’t concern me. 
*Looks out into the far distance, devoid of all emotion. Coolness is your first name, calm your second, and unmoving your third.*
===
title: SuspiciousGuy_QuestFumbled
position: 695,-58
---
<<set $ayanokoji_DialoguePhase = "QuestCompleted">>
<<dialoguePhaseGetter Ayanokoji "QuestCompleted">>
Suspicious Guy: You think you’re so tough huh, trying to be the cool kid when in reality you’re actually a fricken loser.
Suspicious Guy: *spits on player* Don’t talk to me again 
*Go back and tell Ayanokoji the result of your pursuit in Aurafarming* 
===
